<title>USA: Huron, Mich., $1.900 mln won by First of America.</title>
<headline>Huron, Mich., $1.900 mln won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America said it won $1.900 million of Huron Cty, Mich., general obligation Bad Axe water supply and sewage disposal system limited tax bonds, Series A, with a net interest cost of 5.15 percent.</p>
</text>
